imenting on our kids in school is you.\n\nParents didn’t get a say when you accepted millions of dollars from tech developers benefiting o", "url": "https://x.com/jacobwlong87/status/2111462264813596693", "t": "2026-10-17T14:20:07+00:00"}, "role": "poster", "reach": 1174, "pushback_share": 0.0}, {"handle": "cjtackett.bsky.social", "name": "Chris Tackett", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:s7savtl25cqhm3ddqc7jeljx/bafkreieqxzi4zstau5il455lkwonnnqh6pivnry4q2o4gelcx6lkpdehqq", "followers": 0, "account_age_years": 1.9, "posts": 2, "views": 0, "downstream_views": 0, "lanes": {"fort_worth_next_hisd": 2}, "originated": 0, "bridged": 0, "copied": 2, "max_lift": 0.0, "first_mover": [], "top_post": {"id": "at://did:plc:s7savtl25cqhm3ddqc7jeljx/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxw3wfknmk26", "views": 0, "lane": "fort_worth_next_hisd", "text": "I Know You Don’t Care\n\nMary Elizabeth Sheehan came to the Greg Abbott / Mike Morath / TEA appointed Fort Worth ISD Board of Managers meeting on 10/13/26 and LIT. THEM. UP.\n\n“You are not welcome here”\n", "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cjtackett.bsky.social/post/3mxw3wfknmk26", "t": "2026-10-15T12:48:59.667000+00:00"}, "role": "copier", "reach": 0, "pushback_share": 0.0}]